#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESCRIPTION"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions calculate the complex arc cosine of I<z>.  If I<y\\ =\\ "
"cacos(z)>, then I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>.  The real part of I<y> is chosen in the "
"interval [0,pi]."
msgstr ""
"Ces fonctions calculent la valeur complexe de l'arc cosinus de I<z>. Si "
"I<y\\ =\\ cacos(z)>, alors I<z\\ =\\ ccos(y)>. La partie réelle de I<y> est "
"choisie dans l'intervalle [0,\\ pi]."

# Description d'une formule pour le calcul trigonométrique
#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid "One has:"
msgstr "On a :"

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"
msgstr "    cacos(z) = -i * clog(z + i * csqrt(1 - z * z))\n"

